{"job_id":"F-1fe797131853a30eb702","family_id":"F-1fe797131853a30eb702","title":"부동산등기 특별조치법에 따른 과태료 부과ㆍ징수규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":27,"target_id":"a8883fc725cc3e9193df5eb42f4f13dc1977725260dbfccb21549e68290946a7","source_hash":"47422386d46bc0b8f040d06be595cd466a45a48d55b4af273fcceda7de5b61db","text":"关于依据《不动产登记特别措施法》征收行政罚款的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":90,"target_id":"c1f99cc18591e0664fbc2e5af3a763f8f59c1502497aadea3ab5737bdf55cf8c","source_hash":"8c2d1a5747302b4cbb224f6a0f22b90bc3e834a7b069f4e5d904943dcda60723","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定对未按照《不动产登记特别措施法》第十二条第一款申请不动产登记而征收行政罚款的必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":90,"end":431,"target_id":"ddedc5a8553abdc1b3bffa5d783eda2f585eff722d324801dcc17bfd9bada6c3","source_hash":"8d9c9f9f84799b593f681d6b875a6fc4057984cbfb101c044da46fded45600d9","text":"第二条（登记申请期限的计算）登记权人因下列情形之一而未申请登记的，市长、县长或区长（以下简称“市长等”）应当认定登记权人未申请登记有正当理由，该正当理由存在期间不计入《不动产登记特别措施法》（以下简称“本法”）第二条规定的登记申请期限。\n1. 如遇不可抗力，例如自然灾害\n2. 如果有关标的房产的诉讼正在进行中\n3. 如果登记义务人无正当理由未向权利人交付登记申请所需的文件，则适用\n4. 其他情况下，市长等官员承认存在合理的理由不申请注册\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":431,"end":646,"target_id":"a545bb8e235824730375f4afde38d986ffc86ee9550ca62defad525c2dc08110","source_hash":"16f23e9cd4e777c552abbb8cfd170ab6c25e77a801926277a90fdcff0445891b","text":"第三条（行政罚款的征收和减免标准）\n① 市长等应当按照附表所列的行政罚款标准确定行政罚款金额。\n② 农民或渔民为耕种目的取得农田，且其所拥有的农田总面积为30000平方米以下，并且未按照该法第二条第一款的规定申请办理该所取得农田所有权转移登记的，市长等可以减免第一款规定的行政罚款金额的50%。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":646,"end":839,"target_id":"8e6238dca50e3984f64ea35100ce5bc02c720950ec7773c5f97e6ababc7a041c","source_hash":"2c359fbad2a0bc6674a489cef30ea1ff7403efc8e12c451ddf15d2682c65c516","text":"第四条（行政罚款等的征收）\n① 市长等在处以行政罚款时，应当按照《公共秩序违法行为管制法实施令》第4条的规定，在书面文件中说明标的房地产的描述、登记申请事项和违法事项（包括当事人同意的电子文件）。\n② 市长等应当按照所附表格，在《房地产登记申请延误行政罚款处理登记册》中记录和管理有关行政罚款的征收和收取的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":839,"end":892,"target_id":"5a7cdd98ab3be88e22f1ca49ef98e77021ec1475a37eff581e97e7bb30cc2f92","source_hash":"774dc3708dad429528695da1aa595d1161ee03a8709f2878607beb260415b6a0","text":"第五条（行政罚款缴纳期限）行政罚款的缴纳期限为自缴款通知之日起30日内。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"BODY","start":892,"end":2586,"target_id":"a101b8b8602f08aa47243e7dfe66bb8eea323144b405f3457bca7d91f8c83d68","source_hash":"cfaf28cdbbad792583d19ec6decd950b54c146464a8bc200cc5e1fdd7bda3b56","text":"补充规定 <第508号，2024年8月13日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n行政罚款的适用标准（与第三条第一款相关）\n■ 根据不动产登记特别措施法征收行政罚款的规则 [附表]                      \n\n  行政罚款的适用标准（与第三条第一款相关）                                                  \n\n┌──────────────────┬─────────────────────┐\n\n│收费依据│收费金额│\n\n├──────────────────┼─────────────────────┤\n\n│ 过失不足两个月 │ 《地方税法》第十条及第十条之二至第十条 │\n\n│ │税基至同一法第6条、第11条第1款 │\n\n│ │该商品的标准税率（根据同一法第14条制定的条例） │\n\n│ │ 不同，则该税率 │\n\n税率减去每千美元 20%（同一法律 ││ │规定）\n\n│ │关于第11条第1款第8项，20/1000 │\n\n（按税率计算的金额）（相同 ││ │指代）\n\n│ │是该法第13条第2、3、6或7款 │\n\n│ │ 的情况下，该金额的 100% │\n\n│ │300，以及本表中下文“精细标准│\n\n所指“金额”的 5/100 ││ │\n\n├──────────────────┼─────────────────────┤\n\n│ 过失时间超过2个月但不足5个月的，罚款为行政罚款标准金额的15% │\n\n├──────────────────┼─────────────────────┤\n\n│ 过失时间超过5个月但不足8个月的，│ 处以标准行政罚款金额的20% │\n\n├──────────────────┼─────────────────────┤\n\n│ 过失时间超过8个月但不足12个月的，罚款为行政罚款标准金额的25% │\n\n├──────────────────┼─────────────────────┤\n\n│ 过失持续12个月或以上 │ 处以标准行政罚款金额的30% │\n\n└──────────────────┴─────────────────────┘\n\n房地产登记申请延误罚款处理登记簿\n■ 房地产登记特别措施法行政罚款的征收规则 [附表]                                                                               \n\n"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00001","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435245","source_hash":"98d396a52b47a2a77a1c235f6cfad679f533189c53601555ac1f953e5b4dd5eb","text":"■ 根据不动产登记特别措施法征收行政罚款的规则 [附表]"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00002","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435246","source_hash":"72edb2e72ca8f7efddc0874fa17777754e048e2109e021d2a23c4a6cfa8a8c6e","text":"行政罚款的适用标准（与第三条第一款相关）"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00003","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435247","source_hash":"f63a70136f540ac2f5f50b252dbdfa43a06f53acadc7f874c095337167c9f34a","text":"拼版标准"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00004","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435248","source_hash":"9f80a7594683747dc6c90dd0bdb85422e3b3a256be0613921481c2e34b269e1a","text":"收费金额"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00005","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435249","source_hash":"784721fa3d18dae4947ec5b1d927615daa63bd7eda15e138f63a5e963798552d","text":"如果疏忽时间少于 2 个月"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00006","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435250","source_hash":"54e9cb7a82a7ded0d17cdcaf5ec53a1bfbfa19d34183ff7be5ddd1a54c4e6414","text":"地方税法第十条及第十条之二至第十条"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00007","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435251","source_hash":"a4d9c9eaf24af3a7bb926f4c64a26d1ae0ca7fa253221c4f6d852dc5895e515a","text":"关于同一法案第6条及之前税基的规定，第11条第1款规定了以下事项。"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00008","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435252","source_hash":"ac037d47864432f427925c30679323017622fb87bb8de25e0026a80661414b6a","text":"条款（依据同一法第14条制定的条例"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00009","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435253","source_hash":"966630cb53aa38ecf659dcb9a01ffd2450780cb0c078b822d0a0608b058c74cc","text":"，则该税率为"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00010","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435254","source_hash":"45333479642b1bc14c0b85ee8dd99a0d2b9904091b6f3c0be1b8229735c815c7","text":"税率减去每千美元 20%（同一条法律  规定）"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00011","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435255","source_hash":"a076cc5a8fc4d37dbb7dc3c44a8c92e2fc480b625ed7355bc8a6629a30713854","text":"第 11 条第 1 款第 8 项第 20/1,000 行"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00012","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435256","source_hash":"9d3efc7e8d59d6ca60fa71864481ac20e28d409bff01bf158dd70a1865d1ae19","text":"）（参考相同的"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00013","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435257","source_hash":"2d3d3bf66e0dbc0261b45be2f3155883bf05be75138cd29c47252d1c15e2b2f0","text":"是该法第 13 条第 2、3 和 6 款，或 7"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00014","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435258","source_hash":"04a959f359e5e8838f2bc15a873326abaee5937d5d3993a0f2f4d25b1cc8f3ac","text":"条款的情况，该金额的 1/100 为"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00015","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435259","source_hash":"1e600b408390c27637aa4c0d673710fdd5b811f46e7c3bcd979f8548d1ae8a17","text":"300，以及本表中的“罚款标准"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00016","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435260","source_hash":"941699d3a45eb02ffd2d50a27ae515b5faf33628973676cd59a0e9d7fc863890","text":"金额”"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00017","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435261","source_hash":"c426131b2c18ac02696a5e24fa074f2558f482a0704caf56cf54187be68c6963","text":"如果疏于照管 2 个月或以上但不足 5 个月"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00018","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435262","source_hash":"cb1fda5243a1cdc6dd1a5dc179a12ffb222338d133011f22fba3400f55f22e3b","text":"15/100 标准罚款金额"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00019","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435263","source_hash":"4fae3d2767b605e9030f1140a6e0821c284d3610e13e9bc1949ffe3fe4fb8fc3","text":"如果疏于维护 5 个月或以上但不足 8 个月"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00020","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435264","source_hash":"a7747f50a2ff9c6e0af481f7865a223a592d524e10cf4e3ea6e3d4fc4a887847","text":"标准罚款金额的20/100"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00021","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435265","source_hash":"a8da9a34f9165ddd68c38c73084808ee132cab62a7a4895c93580d4dd90cd057","text":"如果疏于照管的时间达到或超过 8 个月但不足 12 个月，则适用"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00022","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435266","source_hash":"955df44d7fad60654f1c1f2772a6f4bc0e020e719551ce2d45ba06a247bfc6c1","text":"标准罚款金额的 25%"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00023","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435267","source_hash":"cf114e6a50642a119361896adcccd96052961addc9c75e8b341114b32c6a809d","text":"如疏忽12个月或以上"},{"id":"A33561-zh-00024","doc":"A33561","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435268","source_hash":"2ed907cd520c4400c8668c8710b56b5b442c6f40c9ef3d256cbac701075e21b8","text":"标准罚款金额的30/100"},{"id":"A33562-zh-00001","doc":"A33562","law_id":"kr-007290-264885-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2435269","source_hash":"b0a41436562026c1990956d21fedc73281fa3001c1eb0703b6506fa3dc30d6c6","text":"■ 房地产登记特别措施法行政罚款的征收规则 [附件]"},{"id":"A33562-zh-00002","doc":"A33562","law_id":"kr